  {
   "index": 9,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "role=main",
    "section",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 177,
   "text": "The standard packaging tools are all designed to be used from the command\nline.\nThe following command will install the latest version of a module and its\ndependencies from PyPI:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1028,
    "height": 67,
    "widthFraction": 0.56,
    "leftFraction": 0.27,
    "pageFraction": 0.29,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "tag": "div",
   "class": "admonition note",
   "landmarks": [
    "role=main",
    "section",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 310,
   "text": "python -m pip install SomePackage\nNote\nFor POSIX users (including macOS and Linux users), the examples in\nthis guide assume the use of a virtual environment.\nFor Windows users, the examples in this guide assume that the option to\nadjust the system PATH environment variable was selected when installing\nPython.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 3,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.06,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1111,
    "height": 181,
    "widthFraction": 0.56,
    "leftFraction": 0.27,
    "pageFraction": 0.31,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "role=main",
    "section",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 270,
   "text": "It’s also possible to specify an exact or minimum version directly on the\ncommand line. When using comparator operators such as >, < or some other\nspecial character which get interpreted by shell, the package name and the\nversion should be enclosed within double quotes:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1308,
    "height": 78,
    "widthFraction": 0.56,
    "leftFraction": 0.27,
    "pageFraction": 0.37,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 12,
   "tag": "pre",
   "landmarks": [
    "role=main",
    "section",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 120,
   "text": "python -m pip install SomePackage==1.0.4 # specific version\npython -m pip install \"SomePackage>=1.0.4\" # minimum version",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
